WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/components/ai/AIAnomalyExplanations.tsx — the Helix anomaly-explanation card. It is
  `withAiFeature('anomaly-explanations', InnerSection)` (a `useAiEnabled` gate; disabled ⇒ the HOC
  renders `null`). InnerSection uses `useTranslation` + `useAiStream({ url: '/ai/anomalies/explain',
  body: { vehicle_id: vehicleId ?? 0, days: 30 }, onEvent: noop })` and renders the shared
  `AIFeatureCard` with title `t('anomaly.aiExplanation.title','Helix explanation')`, a description,
  button `t('anomaly.aiExplanation.generateButton','Generate explanation')`, badge
  `t('anomaly.aiExplanation.badge','Helix')`, `canStart = vehicleId != null`, and the stream handle.

  Composed shared primitives reproduced for parity (their native atoms are owned by the P4 component-
  library bundle — out of scope here and not yet present — so they are reproduced as private subviews
  scoped to this surface, the only files this prompt may touch):
    • AIFeatureCard  : GlassPanel → (title + AIBadge) → description → universal "Ask Helix" button
                       (idle "Ask Helix" / streaming "Helix is thinking…"; disabled = !canStart ||
                       isStreaming; aria-label "Ask Helix · {buttonLabel}") → AiOutputPanel.
    • AiOutputPanel  : nothing while idle+empty; "Helix error: {message}" in error; AIThinkingIndicator
                       (shimmer lines + dots) while streaming before the first delta; else the prose.
    • useAiStream    : idle → streaming → (done | error); `delta.text` frames accumulate; a non-OK HTTP
                       response finalises as "stream_http_{status}"; unknown SSE event types dropped.

